s=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是顶点集，不是集合宇宙 (set-coded hypergraph data)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6UniformHypergraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6UniformHypergraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Hypergraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Hypergraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Set}^3\\)</span> (hypergraph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"22c421a655624500\" href=\"?note=22c421a655624500\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Set}\">\\(\\mathsf{Set}\\)</span> 为集合变量的元类型；此类型记号不表示顶点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}hypergraph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6UniformHypergraph}_S(H,V,E,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb6Hypergraph}_S(H,V,E)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\forall e\\in E\\;(|e|=\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabi